> sec(0.5)
1.13949
> csc(0.5) * sin(0.5)
1
> cot(1) * tan(1)
1
> atan(1) * 4
3.14159
> copysign(2, -0.0)
-2
> fma(2, 3, 1)
7
> f(x: f32) = fma(x, x, -1.0)
> show f
f(x: f32) = fma(x, x, -1)
  -> f32
> diff atan(x)
d/dx atan(x) = 1/(x^2 + 1)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 1e-15)
> diff sec(x)
d/dx sec(x) = sec(x)*tan(x)
  holds for cos(x) != 0
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 4e-07)
> diff cot(x)
d/dx cot(x) = -1/sin(x)^2
  holds for sin(x) != 0
  check: matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 3e-06)
> diff copysign(x, 2)
d/dx copysign(x, 2) = sign(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 1e-15)
> cost fma(x: f32, x, 1.0f)
cost of fma(x, x, 1) under gt1030: 1 (1 operations, shared subterms counted once)
  fmul             1 x 1     = 1
> h(x: f32 in -1..1) = copysign(abs(x), x)
> g(x: f32 in -1..1) = x
> equiv h g
h and g are equal on the domain of h (sampled, not proved; no SAT proof: a float or real value)
